    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίμ-βολος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reversed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμη</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				298
			</span></i>: hence, <i>untrustworthy, unstable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤθη π. καὶ</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπιστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					705a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				31.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολερὸς καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλιμβολία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.40
			</span></i>; of a slave, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίμπρατος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				445
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδιλα π.</span>
			<i>turned</i> or <i>patched</i> sandals, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				85
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					3.132
				</span></i>
			.</div>
